SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Thursday May 14th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with
  **Love Songs that Stir the Soul.**\n\nSongs that I have written for well 
 over 36 years.\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWonderful new songs every
  week!\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time after 8:30 pm (Eastern Ti
 me)\n\\*You are also welcome to come on later in the evening as well\n**\\
 *\\*Attend for free if you like - if it's your first time attending :)**\n
 \nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Songwriter/Produ
 cer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the S
 oul (Thursday May 14th)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original Lyrics and Songs b
 y Songwriter and Producer Steve Flemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, love songs\, 
 spiritual songs\, songs about nature\, our culture\, our past\, our future
 \, relationships and our lives\n\nI'll be playing a mix of songs using a f
 usion of mixed genres like\, **Folk\, Traditional Folk\, Country\, Blue Gr
 ass\, Singer Song Writer\, Soft Rock\, Easy Listening\, Classic Rock\, R &
  B\, Gospel\, Pop\, Adult Contemporary\, Indie Rock/Po**p and many others 
 genres too. So please sit back and get ready to have an amazing auditory e
 xperience in the comforts of your own home :)\n\n\\*You can come on and of
 f at any time during the night- starting at 8:30 pm\n\n**About Steve Flemm
 ing:**\nHighly influenced by the great singer songwriters of the 50s\, 60s
 \, 70s\, 80s and 90s. I have been writing my own songs since 1990. Songs a
 bout life\, love\, loss\, hope\, faith\, joy\, romance\, memories\, spirit
 uality and heartbreak. Songs that are universal\, heartfelt and often rele
 vant to the lives of many others.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee
 :**\n\n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e tran
 sfer or pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can co
 ntribute is greatly appreciated to help support this meaningful musical en
 deavor and song loving community\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://us04web.z
 oom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Testimonials from Past Events:**\nYour songs are wonder-
 full\, speak to emotions\, experiences and moments we've all felt and live
 d. S. B.\nSteve Flemming is an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the so
 ul. He transforms everyday thoughts and life into beautiful poetry and mag
 ical tunes. Amazing stuff yet again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for a
  night of heartfelt\, exhilarating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks fo
 r having me my friend. I love your words\, they calm me and energize me at
  the same time I'll look forward to your next invite\nM.Z.\nThese great so
 ngs definitely helped me to decompress after a long day. Keep up the song 
 writing Steve\, these are great! - S.S.\nThank you so much for a relaxing 
 evening and sharing your inspiring music Steve! I am excited to hear more 
 and I hope you do this again!! - C.B\nLovely songs and a great vibe with w
 onderful people. I couldn’t have asked for a better way to close my day.
  Huge thanks Steve\, for inviting me! I truly enjoyed every moment! - N.A.
 \nThe lyrics are amazing. From the heart...\nThanks Steve for the amazing 
 tunes. I'm truly blown away. Very glad I joined.\n\\- E\\.E\\.\n\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-
